96
00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.280
Milline naine?

97
00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:54.040
Hulluks võib minna.

98
00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:56.190
Te

99
00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.670
