kavatsetakse tapmist.

125
00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:40.545
Te peate vahele astuma.

126
00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:46.095
Hinkus, Hinkus,

127
00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:38.250
ei kas

128
00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:43.820
