et ma poleks, poleks aru saanud.

184
00:31:23.510 --> 00:31:26.850
Vaadake,
siin peaks olema midagi teie erialal.

185
00:31:35.340 --> 00:31:38.315
Kust te selle saite?
See on Olavi oma.

186
00:31:42.770 --> 00:31:44.970
Saamatu,

187
00:31:57.680 --> 00:31:59.830
